@startuml KTOB_16_state_offer
title KTOB - R1 Saved Offer Lifecycle
[*] --> OBSERVED : seller listing found or entered
OBSERVED --> SAVED : reader explicitly saves snapshot
OBSERVED --> [*] : not saved
SAVED --> REMOVED : DELETE /saved-offers/{id}
REMOVED --> [*]
note right of OBSERVED
OBSERVED is a transient lookup state, not persisted.
It is not a verified offer without an actual source.
end note
note right of SAVED
An offer keeps immutable observedAt provenance.
R1 has no automatic recheck or price-change alerts.
end note
note bottom of REMOVED
Seller click or removal never creates an acquisition.
end note
@enduml
